<title>ITALY: Italy records bop deficit of 1.957trln lire in Feb.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop deficit of 1.957trln lire in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 1.957 trillion lire deficit in February, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     Feb 97	  Jan 97    Feb 96</p>
<p> Total		     -1,957	  +5,322	-917</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  +3,365	  +5,322	-924</p>
<p> Capital movements	 +571	 +12,758    -1,626</p>
<p>  -Year to date	 +13,329	 +12,758    -1,404</p>
</text>
